{
    "word": "unlove",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "104b4ce2-7a5d-30a6-b00f-84de1132bd8f",
                "word": "unlove",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6550ff84-c4fc-3984-8c2e-eb3e480ba1ba",
                        "entry_id": "104b4ce2-7a5d-30a6-b00f-84de1132bd8f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The lack, absence, or omission of love; lovelessness; enmity; neglect; hate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b36d1b00-089e-430c-be62-0bef0a3dbe77",
                                "sense_id": "6550ff84-c4fc-3984-8c2e-eb3e480ba1ba",
                                "text": "Disgust, nausea, loathing—some aspects of yourself and others surely deserve such abhorrent gut responses. But disgust doesn't create suffering— recoil does. Separation is the act of unlove."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "faf116c1-89ec-4bd2-8096-96cd2882bb3e",
                                "sense_id": "6550ff84-c4fc-3984-8c2e-eb3e480ba1ba",
                                "text": "How do you experience this sense of unlove in your body? Notice the specific quality of the bodily […] Then see if you can let the feeling of unlove be there just as it is, without trying to fix it, change it, or judge it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6dd63c6d-f52b-4c85-8790-6c98296aa5e4",
                                "sense_id": "6550ff84-c4fc-3984-8c2e-eb3e480ba1ba",
                                "text": "All the most intractable problems in human relationships can be traced back to “the mood of unlove,” a deep-seated suspicion most of us harbor […] The mood of unlove that Wellwood describes is pervasive in our culture."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "45e6e8f0-1df6-43f2-ac69-8d5b9546c63f",
                        "source_entry_id": "104b4ce2-7a5d-30a6-b00f-84de1132bd8f",
                        "source_sense_id": "6550ff84-c4fc-3984-8c2e-eb3e480ba1ba",
                        "source_sense_description": "lack of love",
                        "target_lang_word": "désamour",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "désamour",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7011428-090c-36b7-9e01-106a32e0d700",
                                        "entry_id": "a454aa8c-c66a-3f78-b6ca-c4b09823a5dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cessation de l’amour ; refroidissement des relations amoureuses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27af7d6f-870a-4d8f-b981-3cb43bad2e70",
                                                "sense_id": "b7011428-090c-36b7-9e01-106a32e0d700",
                                                "text": "Vostre desamour et nonchalence d’aimer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcaebb70-02a9-4ccd-9a10-43a0c328506b",
                                                "sense_id": "b7011428-090c-36b7-9e01-106a32e0d700",
                                                "text": "Le désamour est-il inéluctable?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b9b8108-3699-300a-b481-9890ac8210b5",
                                        "entry_id": "a454aa8c-c66a-3f78-b6ca-c4b09823a5dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Éloignement après une période de liens étroits."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "098df5d7-1b7c-41f6-8291-e8003509bc69",
                                                "sense_id": "9b9b8108-3699-300a-b481-9890ac8210b5",
                                                "text": "La capitale attire toujours les meilleurs chercheurs et les étudiants de toute la France. Il n’y a pas de désamour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e55605a4-ea0f-429b-b9c2-ba0fff01fb65",
                                                "sense_id": "9b9b8108-3699-300a-b481-9890ac8210b5",
                                                "text": "[Titre] Les enseignants et la gauche : le désamour ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d08310f-acec-46ab-920c-5342d3db13b4",
                                                "sense_id": "9b9b8108-3699-300a-b481-9890ac8210b5",
                                                "text": "À force de voir leur qualité de vie décliner dans leur quotidien, le désamour s’est peu à peu installé entre Valérie Plante et une part croissante de ses citoyens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "387ac297-b09b-410c-81d7-a9c80f2f2a0f",
                                                "sense_id": "9b9b8108-3699-300a-b481-9890ac8210b5",
                                                "text": "Les chiffres illustrent un désamour envers Denis Coderre, indique Anie Samson."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
